               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "add circular queue for logs ring buffer",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "CircularQueue_DoubleLinkList, CircuqueQueue_Array (like circular array or ring buffer). Have ‘max size’. For now – no error if overflow, but could have EnqueButCrashIfFull or throwiffull – see if I have another queue (fixed size) impl like that? ",
