                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "text" : "(NOTE – special case of crash on full not needed. Can just use a regular queue and have subtype that crashes/fails if full. What makes this idffernt is that you push and get overwrite of older items) ",
